From ae19868753c5bcc2044e331d7a64187e58dde619 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jake Fineman <jake@wave.online>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 22:39:23 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] avdevice/decklink: fix build on macOS by defining
 IID_IUnknown

Commits 0cd75dbfa0 and 27e94281d1 added QueryInterface()
implementations that compare the requested interface against
IID_IUnknown. The Linux SDK defines it in LinuxCOM.h and the Windows
SDK gets it from the platform COM headers, but the macOS SDK uses
CoreFoundation's COM types from <CoreFoundation/CFPlugInCOM.h>, which
only provide IUnknownUUID as a CFUUIDRef. Since then, building with
--enable-decklink on macOS fails:

  libavdevice/decklink_dec.cpp:138:43: error: use of undeclared
  identifier 'IID_IUnknown'
  libavdevice/decklink_dec.cpp:603:43: error: use of undeclared
  identifier 'IID_IUnknown'
  libavdevice/decklink_enc.cpp:120:39: error: use of undeclared
  identifier 'IID_IUnknown'
  libavdevice/decklink_enc.cpp:181:39: error: use of undeclared
  identifier 'IID_IUnknown'

On macOS, REFIID is CFUUIDBytes, so derive IID_IUnknown from
IUnknownUUID with CFUUIDGetUUIDBytes(), the same definition used by
the macOS samples shipped with the DeckLink SDK. This avoids
duplicating the GUID bytes, and CFUUIDGetConstantUUIDWithBytes()
returns a constant that must not be released. The definition is
limited to __APPLE__, so Linux and Windows builds are unchanged.

Tested with DeckLink SDK 16.0 and Apple clang 21 on macOS arm64.

Signed-off-by: Jake Fineman <jake@wave.online>
(cherry picked from commit 215351c1c37dc0345a6794f4c96af54cf30e1c7b)
---
 libavdevice/decklink_common.h | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libavdevice/decklink_common.h b/libavdevice/decklink_common.h
index 11430787ce..bd0f59dc5e 100644
--- a/libavdevice/decklink_common.h
+++ b/libavdevice/decklink_common.h
@@ -103,6 +103,11 @@ static inline bool DECKLINK_IsEqualIID(const REFIID& riid1, const REFIID& riid2)
 }
 #endif
 
+#ifdef __APPLE__
+/* The macOS SDK only provides IUnknownUUID. */
+#define IID_IUnknown CFUUIDGetUUIDBytes(IUnknownUUID)
+#endif
+
 class decklink_output_callback;
 class decklink_input_callback;
 
